<title>THAILAND: Tipco Asphalt third quarter net higher.</title>
<headline>Tipco Asphalt third quarter net higher.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results for the first nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 1.87			1.57</p>
<p>    Net			201.15		    158.45</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 4.54     vs	     4.11</p>
<p>    Net			470.12     vs	   291.25</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Tipco Asphalt Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
